@startuml
title UML — Communication Diagram (PlantUML approximation)

' PlantUML doesn't have a dedicated communication-diagram syntax;
' we use object diagram + numbered messages on the links.

object Customer
object UI
object API
object OrderSvc
object DB

Customer ..> UI       : 1 : place order
UI       ..> API      : 2 : POST /orders
API      ..> OrderSvc : 3 : createOrder()
OrderSvc ..> DB       : 4 : INSERT
DB       ..> OrderSvc : 5 : orderId
OrderSvc ..> API      : 6 : 201
API      ..> UI       : 7 : 201
UI       ..> Customer : 8 : confirmation
@enduml
